    {
      "id": "eb5121f5-60fc-474d-a387-6414c8c81a1a",
      "name": "Template Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -720,
        220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 460,
        "height": 560,
        "content": "### How it works\nEvery day at 10 AM the workflow reads your open quotes from Google Sheets and finds the ones due for a touch \u2014 day 2 gets an email, day 7 an SMS, day 14 a final SMS. Before each touch it re-checks the quote status via your CRM/quoting tool (the HTTP node you configure) and skips anything already closed. An AI agent writes each follow-up in your business's voice, sends it via Gmail or Twilio, and logs every touch back to the sheet.\n\n### Setup\n1. Connect your own credentials (every credential slot is a placeholder \u2014 nothing is included): OpenAI, Google Sheets, Gmail, Twilio.\n2. Fill the CONFIG node: business name, owner email, Twilio number, sheet ID.\n3. Create Google Sheets tabs: Quotes, Touches, ClosedLog.\n4. Point the \"Check Quote Status - HTTP\" node at your CRM or quoting tool.\n5. Activate the workflow."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
